# Drop screenshots here

The README references the following filenames. Capture the running app
(`npm run dev`) and save them in this folder so they show up in the README.

- hero.png               — wide shot of the bike on the island
- haw-landmark.png       — info card open at HAW Kiel
- designa-landmark.png   — info card open at Designa
- kebab-landmark.png     — info card open at the Dönerladen
- info-card.png          — close-up of the glassmorphism info card
- mobile.png             — mobile layout with the D-pad visible

Recommended resolutions:
- hero / mobile: 1920x1080 (or 1284x2778 for portrait phone shots)
- landmark + card details: 1280x720 is plenty
